OL,3,GNEWSATeen spends holidays making school
OL,4,Aplay equipment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old has spent his summer
OL,7,Fholidays creating play equipment for a
OL,8,Fprimary school.
OL,10,FHarry, from Whale Hill in
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough, has spent the last few
OL,12,Fweeks hard at work creating a pirate
OL,13,Fship, a fort and a bus out of spare
OL,14,Fwood.
OL,16,FHe has been using supplies and building
OL,17,Fmaterials from local traders and has
OL,18,Fworked hard to try to fire the
OL,19,Fimaginations of pupils at Whale Hill
OL,20,FPrimary School.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
